DestroyFunc MouseDrag
AddToFunc   MouseDrag
+ I Raise
+ M $0
+ D $1

DestroyFunc WindowListFunc
AddToFunc   WindowListFunc
+ I Iconify off
+ I FlipFocus
+ I Raise
+ I WarpToWindow 50 50

DestroyFunc MaxCenter
AddToFunc   MaxCenter
+ I Maximize 75 100
+ I Current (Maximized) Move 50-50w 50-50w Warp

DestroyFunc SafeToDesk
AddToFunc   SafeToDesk
+ I ThisWindow (Sticky) Stick
+ I MoveToDesk $0 $1

DestroyFunc ResizeWarp
AddToFunc   ResizeWarp
+ I Resize $0 $1
+ I WarpToWindow 50 50

# mouse bindings
Mouse 1      R N   Menu rootmenu
Mouse 3      R N   WindowList CurrentAtEnd, IconifiedAtEnd, NoCurrentDeskTitle, \
                   NoGeometry, NoHotkeys, NotAlphabetic

Mouse 1     FS N   MouseDrag Resize Lower
Mouse 2     FS N   MouseDrag Move
Mouse 3     FS N   MouseDrag Move

Mouse 1    FSW 4   MouseDrag Move Lower
Mouse 2    FSW 4   Iconify
Mouse 2    FSW 4S  Sticky
Mouse 3    FSW 4   MouseDrag "Resize Direction SE warptoborder"

# key bindings
Key   d      A 4   Exec exec $[infostore.dmenucmd]
Key   d      A 4S  Menu rootmenu
Key   Return A 4   Exec exec $[infostore.terminal]

Key   Print  A N   Exec exec $[infostore.scrotcmd]
Key   Print  A 4   Exec exec $[infostore.scrotcmd] s

Key   q      A 4   Iconify
Key   q      A 4S  Close

Key   r      A 4   Raise
Key   r      A 4S  Lower
Key   Tab    A 4   Next (CurrentDesk, !Focused, !Iconic, AcceptsFocus) WarpToWindow 50 50
Key   Tab    A M   WindowList Root c c CurrentAtEnd, IconifiedAtEnd, NoCurrentDeskTitle, \
                   NoGeometry, NoHotkeys, NotAlphabetic, SelectOnRelease Alt_L

Key   f      A 4   Maximize
Key   f      A 4S  Maximize Fullscreen
Key   v      A 4   Maximize 0 100
Key   v      A 4S  Maximize 100 0
Key   Space  A 4   MaxCenter


Key   1      A 4   GotoDesk 0 0
Key   2      A 4   GotoDesk 0 1
Key   3      A 4   GotoDesk 0 2
Key   4      A 4   GotoDesk 0 3
Key   5      A 4   GotoDesk 0 4

Key   1      A 4S  SafeToDesk 0 0
Key   2      A 4S  SafeToDesk 0 1
Key   3      A 4S  SafeToDesk 0 2
Key   4      A 4S  SafeToDesk 0 3
Key   5      A 4S  SafeToDesk 0 4

# y u |  k
#  g  | h l
# b n |  j
# manipulate windows
Key   g      A 4   Move 50-50w 50-50w Warp
Key   y      A 4   Move 0 0 Warp
Key   u      A 4   Move 100-100w 0 Warp
Key   b      A 4   Move 0 100-100w Warp
Key   n      A 4   Move 100-100w 100-100w Warp

Key   h      A 4   Move w-100p keep Warp
Key   j      A 4   Move keep w+100p Warp
Key   k      A 4   Move keep w-100p Warp
Key   l      A 4   Move w+100p keep Warp

Key   h      A 4C  Move shuffle Warp left
Key   j      A 4C  Move shuffle Warp down
Key   k      A 4C  Move shuffle Warp up
Key   l      A 4C  Move shuffle Warp right

Key   h      A 4S  ResizeWarp w-100p keep
Key   j      A 4S  ResizeWarp keep w+100p
Key   k      A 4S  ResizeWarp keep w-100p
Key   l      A 4S  ResizeWarp w+100p keep

Key   h      A 4CS Maximize True growleft 0
Key   j      A 4CS Maximize True 0 growdown
Key   k      A 4CS Maximize True 0 growup
Key   l      A 4CS Maximize True growright 0
